-- =============================================================================
-- Migration: 038_hotel_cover_refresh.sql
-- Description: Refresh cover_image_url for 199 luxury_hotels whose
--              Virtuoso brochure images had 404d. New images were sourced from
--              each hotel’s official site, mirrored into the hotel-covers
--              Supabase Storage bucket (scripts/patch_hotel_covers.js +
--              scripts/mirror_hotel_images.js), and the rows repointed to the
--              permanent Supabase public URLs recorded below.
-- Idempotent: plain UPDATEs keyed on slug; safe to re-run.
-- Note: 4 additional hotels (casa-angelina-italy, grand-hotel-principe-di-
--       piemonte-italy, mykonos-grand-hotel-resort-greece, rockresorts-the-
--       arrabelle-at-vail-square-united-states) block server-side fetches (403)
--       and remain in the missing-image backlog for a browser-render pass.
-- =============================================================================

